From e07756dee79fecc6e85a54c8f0bdb957bfbccfb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quiet-of-far <145577751+Quiet-of-far@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:55:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(power): preserve charge cap with session-aware buck
 policy

Keep the standard end threshold and fixed five-point hysteresis.
Pause both charging paths at the cap and retain input supply. Resume
through normal JEITA policy and confirmed charge-enable feedback.
Serialize sysfs and sleep with the charging worker.

Signed-off-by: Quiet-of-far <145577751+Quiet-of-far@users.noreply.github.com>
---
